<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves key rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves key rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it left key rates unchanged at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>It offered to inject up to 500 billion escudos into the money market in a variable rate repurchase pact effective tomorrow. Bids must be submitted by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>Most analysts polled by Reuters had expected the central bank to leave key rates unchanged.</p>
</text>
